### Run these from IntelliJ / VS Code (REST Client extension), or copy the URLs into Postman.
@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. List all pipelines
GET {{host}}/api/etl/pipelines

### 2. Example 1 - single collection (payments) - INCREMENTAL, wait for result
POST {{host}}/api/etl/pipelines/payment-pipeline/run?loadType=INCREMENTAL

### 3. Example 2 - multiple collections - run in background (HTTP 202), then poll step 5
POST {{host}}/api/etl/pipelines/transaction-pipeline/run?loadType=INCREMENTAL&async=true
X-Triggered-By: mahesh

### 4. FULL load (truncate fact table, read every document again)
POST {{host}}/api/etl/pipelines/payment-pipeline/run?loadType=FULL

### 5. Job status + steps
GET {{host}}/api/etl/jobs/1

### 6. Job history (filters are optional)
GET {{host}}/api/etl/jobs?pipelineName=payment-pipeline&limit=20

### 7. Only failed jobs
GET {{host}}/api/etl/jobs?status=FAILED

### 8. Rejected records (filters are optional)
GET {{host}}/api/etl/rejected-records?pipelineName=payment-pipeline&errorType=CORRUPT

### 9. Rejected records count per pipeline / collection / error type
GET {{host}}/api/etl/rejected-records/summary

### 10. After fixing documents in MongoDB: re-process only the rejected ones
POST {{host}}/api/etl/pipelines/payment-pipeline/run?loadType=RETRY_REJECTED

### 11. DEV ONLY - reload sample data into MongoDB and empty all PostgreSQL tables
POST {{host}}/api/dev/reset?cleanPostgres=true

### 12. Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### ---------------- DATA INGESTION (sample-data JSON files -> MongoDB) ----------------

### 13. Files that can be ingested
GET {{host}}/api/ingestion/sample-data/files

### 14. Ingest ALL files (mode = REPLACE | APPEND | SKIP_IF_EXISTS, default REPLACE)
POST {{host}}/api/ingestion/sample-data?mode=REPLACE

### 15. Ingest ONE file (with or without .json)
POST {{host}}/api/ingestion/sample-data/payments.json?mode=REPLACE
